                  <items count="15">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Rebuilds the TimberModel from a StructuralModel: beams from their segments, sections and orientation, with the original GUIDs, results attached as beam.attributes['analysis']. Joints are not rebuilt (their types are not in the neutral model). Use it when only the analysis model is at hand - a JSON from the engineer, an earlier run - or to get the calculated model as timber elements.</item>
